      "subject": "לאלה",
      "rationale": "Hibru i tok 'ol bai i kamap tok bilong man i swear nogut' — man i save usim nem bilong ol long swear, i no ol yet i swear."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Na bai mi tekim ⟨את⟩ ol man i stap liklik bilong Yuda, ol we ol dai putim pes bilong ol long go long graun bilong Mitsrayim long stop long hap; na olgeta bai i pinis — long graun bilong Mitsrayim ol bai i pundaun; long bainat na long hangre ol bai i pinis; long liklik man inap long bikpela man, long bainat na long hangre ol bai i dai; na bai ol i kamap long tok bilong man i swear nogut, long samting i kirapim sot na long tok nogut, na long sem.",
